%% U3 - 01 Modular Menu System (English)
%% Runtime communication / sequence diagram
%% Participant names, node names and dispatcher names are intentionally untranslated.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player as Player (WASD / Inputs)
    participant PC as BP_FrontEnd_PlayerController
    participant HUD as WBP_MainHUD
    participant Stack as Menu Widget Stack
    participant MainMenu as WBP_ButtonsMainScreen
    participant PopupStack as Popup Widget Stack
    participant ConfirmUI as WBP_ConfirmScreen

    Note over PC,HUD: Phase 1 - Scene Initialization (ce246m0h)
    PC->>HUD: Create Widget (WBP_MainHUD) + Add To Viewport
    PC->>Stack: BP_AddWidget (WBP_ButtonsScreen)
    PC->>MainMenu: Dynamic Bind to Dispatchers (OnQuitClicked, OnPlayNewGame)

    Note over Player,MainMenu: Phase 2 - Navigation and Back Action Stack (bku8ap6-)
    Player->>MainMenu: Press Back or ESC
    MainMenu->>PC: Broadcast OnBackHere()
    PC->>Stack: Pop active layer (native CommonUI)

    Note over Player,ConfirmUI: Phase 3 - Decoupled Quit Popup (Mediator Pattern)
    Player->>MainMenu: Click Quit Game
    MainMenu->>PC: Broadcast OnQuitClickedTriggered()
    Note over PC,PopupStack: PlayerController intercepts and orchestrates the transition
    PC->>PC: Set Camera Tag - Quit
    PC->>PopupStack: BP_AddWidget (WBP_ConfirmScreen)
    PC->>ConfirmUI: SetText (Are you sure you want to Quit?)
    PC->>ConfirmUI: ActivateWidget - CommonUI takes input focus

    alt Player presses Cancel
        ConfirmUI->>PC: Broadcast OnCancelConfirmTriggered()
        PC->>PC: Set Camera Tag - Main
        PC->>PopupStack: RemoveWidget (WBP_ConfirmScreen)
    else Player presses Confirm
        ConfirmUI->>PC: Broadcast OnAcceptConfirmTriggered()
        PC->>PC: Native node - Quit Game
    end
